        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106541",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide produced water treatment and recycling services and sell recycled water to our customers for use in drilling and completion operations.",
        "start_character": 18137,
        "end_character": 18288
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106541-b22980da4289d895",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106541",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate a purpose-built, centralized communication hub for our business that is staffed 24 hours per day, seven days per week for coordinating field operations and managing external stakeholder communications, leveraging over 880 live camera feeds, 50,000 direct control inputs per month and various monitoring systems to track pressures, temperatures, flow rates and equipment performance.",
        "start_character": 19486,
        "end_character": 19879
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106541-b22980da4289d895",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106541",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we operated 201 produced water handling facilities with approximately 4.7 million bpd of produced water handling capacity.",
        "start_character": 17621,
        "end_character": 17768
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106541-b22980da4289d895",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106541",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we operated approximately 1.5 million bpd of produced water handling capacity on LandBridge’s surface acreage, with approximately 3.2 million bpd of additional permitted capacity available to us for future development.",
        "start_character": 12816,
        "end_character": 13059
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106541-b22980da4289d895",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106541",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "From January 1, 2018 to December 31, 2025, we constructed approximately 1,000 miles of pipelines and 76 produced water handling facilities across our areas of operation, as well as Desert Environmental’s two energy waste management facilities.",
        "start_character": 4223,
        "end_character": 4466
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106541-b22980da4289d895",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106541",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to organic growth opportunities, we routinely evaluate opportunities to acquire produced water assets owned by E&P companies or third-party water infrastructure companies.",
        "start_character": 10532,
        "end_character": 10715
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106541-b22980da4289d895",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106541",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we are currently constructing the Speedway Pipeline, which will extend across the northern Delaware Basin and connect Eddy and Lea Counties to out-of-basin pore space in the Central Basin Platform owned by LandBridge.",
        "start_character": 4938,
        "end_character": 5168
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106541-b22980da4289d895",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106541",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In particular, during 2025, we constructed large-diameter produced water transportation pipelines and related handling facilities with an initial capacity of 450,000 bpd and the ability to increase capacity to approximately 600,000 bpd, to transport and handle produced water from bpx energy’s development locations in Reeves County, Texas.",
        "start_character": 4467,
        "end_character": 4807
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106541-b22980da4289d895",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106541",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our customers include many of the top-tier operators in the regions in which we operate, including bpx energy, Chevron Corporation, Devon, EOG Resources, Inc.",
        "start_character": 20567,
        "end_character": 20725
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106541-b22980da4289d895",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106541",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Through these agreements, we have access to TPL’s surface within the AMI for pipeline rights of way and the right to operate produced water handling facilities within the AMI as well as the exclusive right to market and sell produced water within the AMI, subject to customary royalty and revenue-sharing payments.",
        "start_character": 6481,
        "end_character": 6795
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106541-b22980da4289d895",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106541",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We expect to continue to prioritize acquisitions of producer-owned water infrastructure assets over third-party assets due, in part, to the opportunity to enter into favorable long-term contracts as part of the transaction.",
        "start_character": 11096,
        "end_character": 11319
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-106541",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-106541-b22980da4289d895",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-106541",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We further enhance our data-driven operations through our proprietary WAVE software platform, a custom forecasting tool that we developed in-house that integrates field-level data with reservoir modeling to generate daily operational and planning forecasts, optimize capacity utilization and capital deployment and provide customers with insights into system capacities, hydraulics and flowback planning.",
        "start_character": 20138,
        "end_character": 20542
      }
    ]
